  "Name": "Adobe Flash Player PCRE Regex Vulnerability",
  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability found in Adobe Flash Player. A compilation logic error in the PCRE engine, specifically in the handling of the \\c escape sequence when followed by a multi-byte UTF8 character, allows arbitrary execution of PCRE bytecode.",
